  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 — .NET 8 LTS support: the package now multi-targets net8.0 and net10.0 with an identical public API on both. The full test suite runs on both frameworks in CI. One behavioral note: the deprecated inline ML-KEM-only recipient mode (PQFE002) depends on platform ML-KEM, which ships in .NET 10 — on net8.0 PqKeyPair.IsSupported is always false and the mode fails closed with PlatformNotSupportedException, exactly as on .NET 10 hosts without OpenSSL 3.5+/CNG. The supported recipient path, PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Hybrid (X25519 + ML-KEM-768 via fully managed BouncyCastle), runs on both targets. No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
